 36AR c  {+35}Cl beam, E=21.70-21.90 MeV produced by the Holifield Radioactive  
 36AR2c  Ion Beam Facility (HRIBF) bombarded a hydrogen gas filled scattering   
 36AR3c  chamber. |a particles were detected by the SIDAR silicon detector      
 36AR4c  array, in coincidence with heavy recoils detected by a Micron Type S1  
 36AR5c  detector. {+1}H({+35}Cl,|a){+32}S events were identified in plots of   
 36AR6c  the energy detected in the SIDAR detectors versus the energy           
 36AR7c  detected in the S1 detector gated on a Time to Amplitude Converter     
 36AR8c  (TAC) peak. Measured E|a, particle-|a coincidence, resonance. Deduced  
 36AR9c  stopping power, resonance strength, angular distribution.              
 36AR c  Resonance strengths deduced using the stopping power calculated by     
 36AR2c  the ORNL code STOPIT.                                                  
 36AR  L 9117         1-                                                        
 36AR cL E,J$ values taken from 1995Ro22.                                       
